@latteAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5019

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Browse the menu (no auth)
GET {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/menu
Accept: application/json

### Login as a waitress — copy the returned token into @token below
# @name login
POST {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carla",
  "password": "carla-2026"
}

### Place an order using the token from the login response above
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

POST {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": 1, "size": "Medium", "quantity": 2 },
    { "menuItemId": 3, "size": "Large", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### List all orders
GET {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Look up a single order by id (replace {orderId} with an id from a previous response)
GET {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/orders/{orderId}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calling an authenticated endpoint without a token fails
GET {{latteAPI_HostAddress}}/orders
Accept: application/json

###
